%% AP-WR-LEAN-41-20261122-r1: semantic integration gates, not a Lean import graph.
%% Edges mean a downstream operational acceptance claim must discharge the
%% upstream boundary. They do not assert that the gate is currently closed.
%% Independent reference proofs and counterexamples were executed while gates
%% remained open; no production changes or deployments are implied.
%% All 41 IDs occur exactly once as obligation groups below.
flowchart TB
  Sources["Pinned six-repository sources and frozen 41-ID specification"]
  Repo["R01 R02: artifact assembly and unique provider binding"]
  Authority["A01 A02: authenticated authority and text non-amplification"]
  Store["Authoritative storage, clock and real operation histories"]
  Tasks["T00–T07: histories, leases, CAS, immutable spec and commit freshness"]
  Effects["E01–E05: durable intake, UNKNOWN fence, takeover and checkpoint identity"]
  Budget["B01–B05: reservation and exact, isolated settlement"]
  Closure["V01 V02 G02: frozen independent evidence and prerequisite closure"]
  Refinement["X01 X02: actual-step refinement and reachable-state invariants"]
  Context["C01 C02 M01 M02: mandatory context, exact wire budget and scoped memory"]
  Lineage["C03 M03 G01: structural evidence, lineage and decreasing fuel"]
  Evolution["H01–H06: protected proposals, heldout gate, CAS promotion and rollback"]
  Environment["Explicit scheduler, resource, network, timeout and reconciliation assumptions"]
  Progress["X03: conditional terminal-or-blocked progress"]
  Open["Open integration gates and scoped counterexamples remain in the acceptance matrix"]

  Sources --> Repo
  Sources --> Authority
  Repo --> Store
  Authority --> Store
  Store --> Tasks
  Authority --> Effects
  Tasks --> Effects
  Effects --> Budget
  Authority --> Budget
  Tasks --> Closure
  Budget --> Closure
  Closure --> Refinement
  Store --> Refinement
  Effects --> Refinement
  Refinement --> Context
  Context --> Lineage
  Closure --> Evolution
  Lineage --> Evolution
  Authority --> Evolution
  Refinement --> Progress
  Evolution --> Progress
  Lineage --> Progress
  Environment --> Progress
  Tasks -. "T02 T06 T07 source counterexamples" .-> Open
  Effects -. "E01 E02 source counterexamples" .-> Open
  Refinement -. "X01 source refinement refuted" .-> Open
  Open -. "Continue independent proofs; withhold integration acceptance" .-> Progress
